# What a graph draws: each node's places, gathered node by node into a list of a type the code names. The loop gives each
# node; `Touch::drawn`, handed by its path to `map`, takes each touch of the node, a part of it, and `collect` gathers the
# Wheres it makes into `places`. `Drawn { id, places }` builds a Drawn from its fields, and `out.push(..)` makes the list
# anew from it. The route gives back a `Vec<Drawn>`: the Drawns the push gathered, at the route's moment.

route drawing.drawn
step drawn/for n in &g.nodes
step drawn/Touch.drawn
step drawn/Touch.drawn/Where()
step drawn/collect                                            # `let places: Vec<Where> = ..collect()`
step drawn/Drawn()                                            # `Drawn { id: n.id.clone(), places }`
step drawn/push                                               # `out.push(..)`

line entry > drawn call
line Graph·g > drawn value                                    # the route's own parameter, from its start
line Graph·g > drawn/for n in &g.nodes value
line drawn/for n in &g.nodes > Node·n@drawn/for n in &g.nodes value
line Node·n@drawn/for n in &g.nodes > drawn/Touch.drawn/Where() value   # `self.op` of each touch, a part of the node
line drawn/Touch.drawn/Where() > Where@drawn/Touch.drawn/Where() value
line Where@drawn/Touch.drawn/Where() > drawn/Touch.drawn value
line drawn/Touch.drawn > Where@drawn/Touch.drawn value
line Node·n@drawn/for n in &g.nodes > drawn/collect value     # `n.touches.iter().chain(&n.instead)`
line Where@drawn/Touch.drawn > drawn/collect value            # `map(Touch::drawn)`, glued into the collect
line drawn/collect > Where·places@drawn/collect value
line Node·n@drawn/for n in &g.nodes > drawn/Drawn() value     # `n.id`
line Where·places@drawn/collect > drawn/Drawn() value
line drawn/Drawn() > Drawn@drawn/Drawn() value
line Drawn@drawn/Drawn() > drawn/push value
line drawn/push > Drawn·out@drawn/push value
line Drawn·out@drawn/push > drawn value                       # given back
line drawn > Drawn@drawn value                                # and given, at the route's moment

home Graph·g drawn
home Node·n@drawn/for n in &g.nodes drawn
home Where@drawn/Touch.drawn/Where() drawn/Touch.drawn
home Where@drawn/Touch.drawn drawn
home Where·places@drawn/collect drawn
home Drawn@drawn/Drawn() drawn
home Drawn·out@drawn/push drawn
home Drawn@drawn drawn

side entry left
